## 6. Contract ABI and Publish Hook

### New file: `/Users/gold/VS code/claude/chess UI/src/contracts/chessLedgerAbi.js`

This is the ABI for the `publishGame` function only (minimal ABI -- we only need the functions we call):

```javascript
export const CHESS_LEDGER_ADDRESS = import.meta.env.VITE_CHESS_LEDGER_ADDRESS;

export const chessLedgerAbi = [
  {
    name: 'publishGame',
    type: 'function',
    stateMutability: 'nonpayable',
    inputs: [
      { name: 'gameId', type: 'string' },
      { name: 'result', type: 'string' },
      { name: 'moves', type: 'string' },
      { name: 'engineColor', type: 'string' },
    ],
