## 8. Tracking Published State in localStorage

### Modified file: `/Users/gold/VS code/claude/chess UI/src/utils/gameManager.js`

Add one new exported function:

```javascript
export function markGamePublished(gameId, txHash) {
  const raw = localStorage.getItem(GAME_PREFIX + gameId);
  if (!raw) return;
  const state = JSON.parse(raw);
  state.txHash = txHash;
  localStorage.setItem(GAME_PREFIX + gameId, JSON.stringify(state));

  // Also update the index entry
  const index = getIndex();
  const entry = index.find(g => g.id === gameId);
  if (entry) {
    entry.txHash = txHash;
    localStorage.setItem(INDEX_KEY, JSON.stringify(index));
  }
}
```

This is the only change to `gameManager.js`. The existing `createGame`, `saveGame`, `loadGame`, `listGames`, `deleteGame` functions are untouched. The `txHash` field is simply an optional addition to the game record -- if present, the game was published on-chain.

